  "scope": "CPU/GPU component controls for current opposing geometry and link-pair source grouping. All four final cases pass on each backend: analytic primitive and mesh queries with live pose changes; U-shaped/cavity boundary distance and material occlusion; selected-environment translation, velocity and reset; two-geoms-per-link grouping with unchanged split-source force/moment and invalid-source isolation. Earlier Mesh-option and velocity-setter test setup failures are retained with their exact source. Queries describe nearest opposing boundaries and do not establish complete reachable support, a pressure law, friction history, production lifecycle behavior, or throughput. The extended goal remains active.",
